+   if(op==RdnaOpcode::SEndpgm||op==RdnaOpcode::SBranch||op==RdnaOpcode::SCbranchScc0||op==RdnaOpcode::SCbranchScc1||op==RdnaOpcode::SCbranchExecz||op==RdnaOpcode::SCbranchExecnz)return false;
+  }
+  if(decoded.instructions[b.instructionBegin].programCounter!=b.startProgramCounter||i.programCounter+4u*i.wordCount!=b.endProgramCounter)return false;
+  const auto target=index(b.terminator.trueBlock),fall=index(b.terminator.falseBlock);
+  const auto condition=[&]()->std::optional<BranchCondition>{switch(i.op){
+   case RdnaOpcode::SCbranchScc0:return BranchCondition::SccZero;
+   case RdnaOpcode::SCbranchScc1:return BranchCondition::SccNonZero;
+   case RdnaOpcode::SCbranchExecz:return BranchCondition::ExecZero;
+   case RdnaOpcode::SCbranchExecnz:return BranchCondition::ExecNonZero;
